    rasConfidence: "High",
    rasEvidence: "RG 'most suited to expressing the poignancy of separation; ranging from romantic and erotic to compassionate and devotional'; Balkwill 1999 chosen for sadness; tanarang 'love and piety'; Parrikar 'the cremation grounds'",
