    narrative: "Sampoorna Malkauns is a seven-swara extension of Malkauns, adding Re and Pa to the pentatonic base. This addition softens the extreme density of pure Malkauns while retaining its dark, meditative character. The raag is less performed than pure Malkauns and is considered a somewhat academic variant, useful for exploring how the addition of the two absent swaras changes the raag's emotional character."
