    variants: ["Madhyamad Sarang","Sur Malhar","Shuddha Sarang","Gaur Sarang (not a Sarang per Parrikar)","Miyan ki Sarang","Samant Sarang","Badhans Sarang","Lankadahan Sarang","Ambika Sarang"],
